### 1. List Canonical Domain Events
# @name listEvents
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/events?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}

###

### 2. Replay a Canonical Event to All Active Webhook Endpoints
# @name replayEventAll
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 3. Replay a Canonical Event to Specific Endpoints Only
# @name replayEventTargeted
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpointIds": [
    "{{endpointId}}"
  ]
}
